//
// Probe: Hash for Value hashes only `id` (rust_dynamic/src/hash.rs:6) while
// PartialEq compares content for two strings (rust_dynamic/src/eq.rs:32).
// Val::ValueMap is a HashMap<Value, Value>, so two structurally equal string
// keys compare == yet hash to different buckets. A lookup with a freshly
// built but equal key should therefore miss.
//
"probe: valuemap, insert under k then read back with a fresh equal k" println
valuemap "k" 42 set "k" get
debug.display_stack
